  "保存项目：K5／K7 选 USER 槽，再按左侧按键组第 4 键（SHIFT、FADER BANK、HOME 之后）保存；覆盖其他已有槽需确认，成功后自动返回。": "Save project: K5 / K7 chooses a USER slot; the 4th button in the left group (after SHIFT, FADER BANK, HOME) writes it. Replacing another occupied slot requires confirmation. The panel returns after saving.",
  "音源预览：Pad 1–6 或 K1 选择，左侧按键组第 4 键（SHIFT、FADER BANK、HOME 之后）应用，HOME 返回；K2 TRACK 即时选择 PROJECT（跟随项目）／LIVE（换项目保留音色）／OFF（关闭音源）。": "Sound source: choose with Pads 1–6 or K1, the 4th button in the left group (after SHIFT, FADER BANK, HOME) to apply, HOME to return. K2 TRACK immediately selects PROJECT (follow projects), LIVE (keep sound across project changes), or OFF (disable the instrument).",
  "预设列表：K7／K5 直接载入，PLAY 载入播放，左侧按键组第 4 键（SHIFT、FADER BANK、HOME 之后）打开项目保存；K1 选 USER／FACTORY。切换直接生效，不提示保存。": "Preset list: K7 / K5 loads immediately, PLAY loads and plays, the 4th button in the left group (after SHIFT, FADER BANK, HOME) opens project saving. K1 chooses USER / FACTORY. Preset changes are immediate, with no save prompt.",
